-- The 319 doctors Referans publishes across its 21 Azerbaijani centres.
--
-- Read from referansclc.com on 2026-09-19, in Azerbaijani. The fifth source,
-- the largest, and the first where one doctor genuinely works in several
-- places at once.
--
-- The total took two counts that had to be reconciled. Walking all 23 centre
-- pages gives 367 profile pages; summing the site's own 59 specialty filters
-- gives 354. The difference is not a gap: 13 doctors have no specialty set on
-- their profile and so appear under no filter, and every doctor a filter
-- returns is also on a centre page. Four of the 367 belong to the Tashkent
-- branch in Uzbekistan and are deliberately not imported - this directory is
-- for people looking for care in Azerbaijan, and four doctors none of them can
-- reach would only pad the counts. That leaves 363 pages.
--
-- 363 pages are 319 people. Thirty of these doctors hold clinics at more than
-- one Referans centre and have a separate page at each: Penah Aliyarov has
-- five, at Naxcivan, Nesimi, Qebele, Quba and Tovuz. Importing the pages would
-- have put the same doctor in the directory five times over. Each person is
-- one row here, attached to every centre that lists them, which is what
-- doctor_clinic has always been for and what no previous source needed.
--
-- Two women named Leyla Eliyeva work at the same laboratory. One is a
-- sonographer who qualified in 2009, the other a laboratory doctor who
-- qualified in 2004, and their photographs are different. They are two rows.
-- Matching on name alone would have merged them and put one woman's
-- credentials on the other, which is the reason the photograph and the stated
-- specialty both have to agree before two pages are called one person.
--
-- Five of these names already exist in this directory. Each was checked
-- against faculty, graduation year and specialty, and all five are different
-- people who happen to share a common Azerbaijani name - our Anar Qurbanov
-- qualified in 2004-2010 and works in paediatric intensive care, theirs
-- qualified in 2008-2014 and is a paediatric surgeon. Three needed a
-- disambiguated slug, because uq_doctor_slug is global and INSERT IGNORE would
-- have dropped them without a word.
--
-- None of these doctors asked to be here. Every row is UNCLAIMED with
-- accepts_bookings = 0.
--
-- Five listings carry no specialty because the site's specialty field holds a
-- job title, a society membership, or a description of a practice that is not
-- a recognised clinical specialty. The listing stays and says nothing it
-- cannot support; no taxonomy code was minted to dignify the entry.
--
-- The Masazir branch is listed by the company but has no doctors, so it gets
-- no clinic row until somebody works there.
--
-- Data only.

INSERT IGNORE INTO specialty (code, name_az, name_en, name_ru, patient_facing, ai_specialty_code, sort_order) VALUES
('allergy-immunology','Allerqologiya və İmmunologiya','Allergology and Immunology','Аллергология и иммунология',1,'general',114),
('genetics','Tibbi genetika','Medical Genetics','Медицинская генетика',1,'general',115),
('psychology','Psixologiya','Psychology','Психология',1,'psych',116);

